{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-25","kind":"proposition","title":"两直线形求作他直线形与一形相似与一形相等","englishTitle":"To construct one and the same figure similar to a given rectilineal figure and equal to another given rectilineal figure.","book":6,"number":25,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.25","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.25/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":25,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","contentId":"euclid-6-25","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9e5c8913dd8e70bce87bbddd6ea1e64118e87150c205a8169c042a18f172450","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-25.statement","euclid-6-25.construction.1","euclid-6-25.construction.2","euclid-6-25.proof.1","euclid-6-25.proof.2","euclid-6-25.proof.3","euclid-6-25.proof.4","euclid-6-25.proof.5","euclid-6-25.proof.6","euclid-6-25.proof.7","euclid-6-25.proof.8","euclid-6-25.conclusion","euclid-6-25.historical.1","euclid-6-25.historical.2","euclid-6-25.historical.3","euclid-6-25.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-25.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b94b55cc67f20cf0b1eac05fc8fc0512de88f251eb42bacbc976508cd22686b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct one and the same figure similar to a given rectilineal figure and equal to another given rectilineal figure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"得出一个与给定直线数字相似的同一个数字,等于给定直线数字。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线形求作他直线形与一形相似与一形相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到两条直线：寻找另一种形状，它与一种形状相似且与一种形状相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6211b71954c90e4ec6be713d463e068b9034c8900dd205ff44c304c49ff340a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be the given rectilineal figure to which the figure to be constructed must be similar, and D that to which it must be equal; thus it is required to construct one and the same figure similar to ABC and equal to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABC是必须与之相似的直线数字,D是必须与之等同的数字;因此,需要构建一个类似ABC和D的同一数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e519c26c2cce9485cc2112193ebb89a6e04ddd880366c939d558d70a7ea8c10","citations":["euclid-1-44","euclid-1-45"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be applied to BC the parallelogram BE equal to the triangle ABC [[I. 44](/principles/euclid-1-44)], and to CE the parallelogram CM equal to D in the angle FCE which is equal to the angle CBL. [[I. 45](/principles/euclid-1-45)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC和BC等值的三角形ABC,BC和CE等值的角FCE,即CBL。（相关点与线段：BE、CM） [[I. 44](/principles/euclid-1-44)] [[I. 45](/principles/euclid-1-45)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0cdae691df35cd3943f9ffb46d295c104732c23b63a5301bf9895acba0949d91","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BC is in a straight line with CF, and LE with EM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC线为CF,LE线为EM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7242df7270cd6fe871120fe88fa731f263f29bc52376a23680544fd40f92698b","citations":["euclid-6-13","euclid-6-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let GH be taken a mean proportional to BC, CF [[VI. 13](/principles/euclid-6-13)], and on GH let KGH be described similar and similarly situated to ABC. [[VI. 18](/principles/euclid-6-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,GH被押比例中项至BC、CF被押,GH被押KGH被押,类似地点为ABC。 [[VI. 13](/principles/euclid-6-13)] [[VI. 18](/principles/euclid-6-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d682988c588d52f0bd1fb622443a7126336005234c162de931fbfbe0699904b9","citations":["euclid-6-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since, as BC is to GH, so is GH to CF, and, if three straight lines be proportional, as the first is to the third, so is the figure on the first to the similar and similarly situated figure described on the second, [[VI. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-19)] therefore, as BC is to CF, so is the triangle ABC to the triangle KGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC对GH的比等于GH对CF的比,如果三条直线为成比例,则第一对三的比例等于第二个直线与类似和类似数字的比,因此,BC对CF的比等于三角ABC对三角KGH的比；BC 与 GH 之比等于 GH 与 CF 之比；BC 与 CF 之比等于 ABC 与 KGH 之比。 [[VI. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77a21ecee3c1da3f7c52e0fa5e0a02af456fdeec722e8af1ab24529efd896a96","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as BC is to CF, so also is the parallelogram BE to the parallelogram EF. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是 BC 与 CF 之比，也等于平行四边形 BE 与平行四边形 EF 的面积之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7dd851d3da64b21e133d0d5fcb08c268ae55832aa1d52c6e388b5b1caa5cd159","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as the triangle ABC is to the triangle KGH, so is the parallelogram BE to the parallelogram EF; therefore, alternately, as the triangle ABC is to the parallelogram BE, so is the triangle KGH to the parallelogram EF. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角ABC对三角KGH的比也等于平行四边形 BE对平行四边形 EF的比;因此,三角ABC对平行四边形 BE的比等于三角KGH对平行四边形 EF的比；ABC 与 KGH 之比等于 BE 与 EF 之比；ABC 与 BE 之比等于 KGH 与 EF 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99346b37a1d5f9afb9b0061878edce03aafa3a8d6d659d4671fe8608521534e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the triangle ABC is equal to the parallelogram BE; therefore the triangle KGH is also equal to the parallelogram EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但三角形ABC等于平行四边形 BE, 所以三角形KGH也等于平行四边形 EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a719f8cabff82936c39f36fd85121544beef6b1c9676afde0ef88396466024d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the parallelogram EF is equal to D; therefore KGH is also equal to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是平行四边形 EF等于D,因此KGH也等于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"da0fd8b6d8cc22992cb63e0e1785e9294d328f886b95459ee2835f9cade513c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And KGH is also similar to ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"KGH也和ABC相似"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58c85ac1042e4e089a3ecf7c5896438cc05c45e060d823286c1600bc7cd96535","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore one and the same figure KGH has been constructed similar to the given rectilineal figure ABC and equal to the other given figure D. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,同样的KGH图与给出的ABC直线图相似,等于另一个直线图D. 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88aa23d76f8eb61087857f9b0bba7f5abe79536a20a50e789e1a851d34c82ffb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线形求作他直线形与一形相似与一形相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到两条直线：寻找另一种形状，它与一种形状相似且与一种形状相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61b870eb37bb50c8314a1cb6894fc688d217624fbb12fb4fe0ea257b36b5a3a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙两直线形求作他直线形与甲相似与乙相等先于求相似之甲形任取一边如丙丁于丙丁边上作平行方形与甲等为丙戊〈一卷四四四五〉次于丁戊边上作平行方形与乙等而戊丁庚角与丁丙己角等为丁辛其丙丁庚己戊辛俱为直线也〈一卷四五可推〉次作一壬癸线为丙丁丁庚之中率〈本篇十三〉末于壬癸上作子形与甲相似而体势等〈本篇十八〉即子形与乙等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：甲乙，构造两条直线，该直线与 甲 相似并等于 乙，前面的相似 甲 形状。例如，丙丁 绘制在边 丙丁 上作为平行四边形，甲 为 丙戊〈一卷四四四五〉，然后在边 丁戊 和 乙 绘制平行四边形，同时 戊丁庚 和 丁丙己 之间的角度等于 丁辛，并且 丙丁庚己戊辛 都是直线。〈一卷四五可推〉 然后绘制一条 壬癸 线，其与 丙丁丁庚 的中位率相同，〈本篇十三〉 在 壬癸 的末端，子 与 甲 相似但与 〈本篇十八〉 的姿态相同，即 子 和 乙 等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9a8d135f215a994efb9872a207c68771a8738326ade0e4670ecdcc99bb2186b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：丙丁壬癸丁庚三线既为连比例即依本篇二十题之系可显一丙丁与三丁庚之比例若一丙丁上之甲与二壬癸上之子两形相似而体势等者之比例也又丙丁与丁庚之比例若丙戊与丁辛两等高平行方形之比例也〈本篇一〉则丙戊与丁辛若甲与子矣夫丙戊与丁辛元若甲与乙也〈丙戊与甲等丁辛与乙等〉则甲与乙之比例若甲与子也〈五卷十一〉而乙形与子形等矣〈五卷九〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：因为线段丙丁、壬癸、丁庚构成连比例，根据本篇第二十题的推论，丙丁与丁庚之比等于分别作在丙丁、壬癸上的两个相似图形甲、子的面积之比。另一方面，同高平行四边形的面积之比等于它们底边之比，所以丙丁与丁庚之比也等于平行四边形丙戊与丁辛的面积之比〈本篇一〉。因此丙戊与丁辛之比等于甲与子之比。又因为丙戊与甲等积、丁辛与乙等积，所以甲与乙之比等于甲与子之比〈五卷十一〉，从而图形乙与图形子面积相等〈五卷九〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-25.source","contentId":"euclid-6-25","revisionId":"euclid-6-25@raw-b9e5c8913dd8e70b","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"927caaaa1b31398d7a2d4ca50b70ba59110583ade251bd0b2282353b6561af85","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.25/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.25\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-25:euclid-1-44:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-25.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-44","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop